Value SYSTEM_ID (\S+)
Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CIRCUIT_ID (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value HOLD_TIME (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_TYPE (\S+)
Value PRIORITY (\S+)
Value AREA (\S+)
Value PEER_IP (\S+)
Value UPTIME (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*System\s+Id\s+Interface\s+Circuit\s+State\s+Hold\s+Type\s+Pri\s+Area\s+PeerIP\s+Uptime\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*-+\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*${SYSTEM_ID}\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${CIRCUIT_ID}\s+${STATE}\s+${HOLD_TIME}\s+${NEIGHBOR_TYPE}\s+${PRIORITY}\s+${AREA}\s+${PEER_IP}\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
